{"script":"yd_041_07","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","noIn":false,"x":-500,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5,"bright":1,"layer":"bg","y":-125,"mirrow":false},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","noIn":false,"x":-500,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5,"bright":1,"layer":"bg","y":-125,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]你听说过戏剧吗？听说黑森林有个剧团，经常在金弦之厅演出，有时也去驿站或者别的聚落表演，口碑也很好。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]最近他们排了一部《湖风剑侠志》改编的新剧，大家都很喜欢，连大书院的文学系教授都夸个不停！[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]我也看了几场，感觉非常不错，剧情跌宕起伏，表演也精彩绝伦，还能体会到真正的侠士精神！[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]而且，雅俗共赏。不管是大富大贵的商人，还是引车卖浆的小贩，都能欣赏这场美好的戏剧。我听说，他们今天会去驿站旅店演出呢！[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]总之……我说那么多就是想说……我这里有两张票，你今晚能和我一起去看吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"}],"des":"埃迪蒂-亲密1"}